# Parser snippets for Custom Parser Studio

Paste one of these into the Custom Parser Studio code editor after uploading the matching folder's files.

## Universal helper utilities

Most snippets use small local helper functions because the browser worker receives plain file text. These functions are repeated where needed so each snippet can be pasted independently.

